Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Reels (iOS): video native AVPlayerLayer'da, ochilishga 20
 s chegara
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

TestFlight'da Reels videosi qora qolardi (UI, like/izoh chiqadi).
iPhone simulyatorida o'lchandi (nova-ios-video-probe.yml): server, URL,
Range (206), Content-Type, H.264 faststart — hammasi to'g'ri; A reel
o'ynab turganda oldindan yuklangan B reelga o'tilganda AVPlayer
`playing`, vaqt yuradi, xato yo'q, lekin ekran 6–9 s qora (markaz
yorug'ligi 76% -> 2%). video_player_avfoundation texture rejimida
pauzada tayyorlangan pleyer kadrlari texture'ga kech yetadi.

- iOS: VideoViewType.platformView (AVPlayerLayer chizadi). Android
  o'zgarmaydi — textureView (ExoPlayer'da muammo yo'q).
- initialize() ga 20 s chegara: osilgan video "qayta urinish"
  holatiga o'tadi va keyingi reel yuklanishini to'smaydi; bosilsa
  yangi pleyer bilan qayta ochiladi (mavjud mantiq).
- reels_ios_video_test: iOS platformView, Android texture, osilish ->
  qayta urinish; eski kodda iOS va osilish testlari yiqiladi.
- FakeVideoPlatform: har pleyerning viewType'i yoziladi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
